@nsobid-FEEE7AFA8A1541BD67AED1A0061FBB57
@flag offset_shift 0x100
@flag print_values
// JP/Chinese XC2 3.0.0, for xc2-recomp (JP release). UIBounds + ScreenFX only.
// The 4K scene-init lines (main+0x700640/44) are deliberately NOT included:
// xc2-recomp's built-in xc2res set patches the same two instructions to read
// the runtime XC2_OUTPUT_RES from its patch page, and a mod that touches them
// switches the whole built-in set off. Set the resolution in-game instead.
@enabled
// UIBounds: logical UI dimensions for layout boundary calculations.
00832DFC 015145BD
00832E10 015545BD
00832E24 015145BD
00832E38 015545BD
// ScreenFX: logical 1280x720 screen-space particle projection.
00862AC0 08A08052
00862AC4 0001231E
00862AD8 085A8052
00862AE0 0201231E
@stop
